  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lifesaving Nutrition Services for the Most Vulnerable Children and Mothers in Sudan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project delivers life-saving nutrition, child protection, and Water, Sanitation, and Hygiene services to vulnerable under five children, pregnant and lactating women in crisis-affected areas of Sudan. It provides early detection and treatment of acute malnutrition, strengthens community-based protection mechanisms, and improves access to safe water, sanitation, and hygiene practices.</narrative>
  </description>
